- **Core Features:**
- - **Agent Guard** — Real-time interception of tool calls, shell commands, file access, HTTP requests
- - **Secret & Data Leak Protection** — Auto-sanitize API keys, SSH keys, PII (e.g., `sk-123abc` → `<SECRET_TOKEN>`)
- - **Prompt Injection Protection** — Detect "ignore instructions", "send secrets", "bypass rules"
- ## Local Data Sanitization
- MoltGuard supports local data sanitization to ensure your sensitive data never leaves your machine:
- - **Local sanitization before LLM calls** — Sensitive data (API keys, SSH keys, PII, credentials) is sanitized locally before being sent to LLM providers
- - **Local restoration after LLM responses** — Sanitized tokens are restored to original values locally when responses return
- - **Sensitive data stays on your machine** — Original values are stored locally and never transmitted to external services
